From f8e44b96b6042da7b38db1b72b0cb0174b096ad8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Khaled <khaledchoucri@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:08:44 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 54/54] POC-16e: type ladders and Omega legendaries in NET
 CHALLENGE

- 8 type ladders (Rock, Fighting, Electric, Fire, Normal, Flying, Psychic, Water) after the
  Champion: 5 foes Lv55-62 in turn, tier-5 rivals, moves from their own level-up learnsets
  (tools/pick_challenge_moves.py). First clear: one rare program each.
- Omega Groudon / Kyogre / Rayquaza (Lv80, boss phases and signature PAs) open once
  FLAG_DEFEATED_* is set (caught or beaten, TerraCave_End/scripts.inc:42-52 and friends):
  cracked ground + sun + 120 s; rain + currents + nothing heals; nothing heals + 150 s + a
  phase every 6 s. Rewards: Tango, AutoHeal, FldrPak1.
- Challenge rules: CHR_BOSS / CHR_NO_HEAL / CHR_FAST_PHASES and an unlock flag; the list
  scrolls (23 entries); the TIME ATTACK page gets an OMEGA column.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FbWSqvcg6G5Gpw6ynvR5tJ
